@host = http://localhost:5024

### 1. Sucesso → 201
POST {{host}}/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ana Silva",
  "cpf": "529.982.247-25",
  "email": "ana@example.com",
  "phone": "(11) 99999-9999"
}

### 2. Duplicado (rode o 1 antes) → 409
POST {{host}}/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ana Silva",
  "cpf": "52998224725",
  "email": "ANA@example.com",
  "phone": "11999999999"
}

### 3. Todos os campos inválidos → 400 com 4 erros
POST {{host}}/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "cpf": "111.111.111-11",
  "email": "ana@",
  "phone": "123"
}

### 4. Campos ausentes → 400
POST {{host}}/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 5. JSON malformado → 400
POST {{host}}/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ana"